DroneBridge provides the foundation: the Wi-Fi AP/STA/LR transports, the
settings/parameter system, the serial <-> MAVLink bridge and routing, and the
REST scaffolding.

This product also includes the fastMAVLink C library (MIT License):

  fastMAVLink - https://github.com/olliw42/fastmavlink

The dual-sonar stack (hardwired UART sonar + Deeper CHIRP+ Wi-Fi sonar with a
reverse-engineered protocol), the persistent sonar log, the dual-slot A/B OTA
system, and the web dashboard are original work by Valentin Danev, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0 as part of this repository.
